(272, 504, '2023-10-10', '', 'Performed system power up but did not continue booting / Replaced bios onboard battery and performed bios system configuration - OK / Performed DARC software loading but an error occured / Performed serial overland loading but failed / We tried to perform full LFC software loading but still failed due to DARC HDD problem', 'System down / HDD is subjected for replacement', 2, 0),
