(436, 698, '2024-02-12', 'Defective xray tube fan power supply', 'Checked PDU unit and found out that the circuit breaker CB3 and CB5 was tripped off / Reset circuit breaker / Power on and noticed that the gantry xray tube cooling fans are not working / Troubleshot and found out that the xray tube cooling fan power supply has a low value output voltage', 'System down due to defective power supply / We recommend for a replacement of xray tube fan power supply / Pls do not try to power / turn on the machine', 2, 0),
